{"seq":1,"slug":"gis-fundamentals","title":"大学地理学 — GIS 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/natural-sciences/geography/gis-remote-sensing/gis-fundamentals","wordCount":2039,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学地理学-gis-基础\">大学地理学 — GIS 基础</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>地理信息系统（GIS, Geographic Information System）是采集、存储、管理、分析和展示空间数据的技术平台。GIS 不仅是一种软件工具，更是一种空间思维方式——它将地理现象转化为可计算、可查询、可可视化的数字模型。掌握 GIS 需要理解空间数据模型（矢量与栅格）、坐标参考系统、空间分析方法（叠加、缓冲、插值）以及制图输出的基本原理。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>核心概念</th>\n<th>定义</th>\n<th>关键内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>空间数据模型</td>\n<td>地理实体的数字表达方式</td>\n<td>矢量（点/线/面）、栅格（像元网格）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>坐标参考系</td>\n<td>将三维地球映射到二维平面的数学框架</td>\n<td>地理坐标系、投影坐标系</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>属性数据</td>\n<td>与空间实体关联的非空间信息</td>\n<td>字段、数据类型、关系表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间分析</td>\n<td>基于位置和拓扑关系的计算操作</td>\n<td>叠加、缓冲、网络分析</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拓扑关系</td>\n<td>空间实体之间的位置关系</td>\n<td>相邻、包含、相交、不相交</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>元数据</td>\n<td>描述数据本身的数据</td>\n<td>来源、精度、时间、坐标系</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一-空间数据模型\">一、空间数据模型</h3><p>GIS 中的空间数据有两种基本表达方式：矢量模型和栅格模型。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;空间数据模型&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;矢量模型&quot;]&#10;    A --&gt; C[&quot;栅格模型&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[&quot;点 Point&lt;br/&gt;城市、采样点&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[&quot;线 Line&lt;br/&gt;道路、河流&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; B3[&quot;面 Polygon&lt;br/&gt;行政区、湖泊&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[&quot;规则网格&lt;br/&gt;每个像元存储一个值&quot;]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[&quot;应用: DEM、遥感影像&lt;br/&gt;土地利用分类&quot;]\">graph TD\n    A[\"空间数据模型\"] --&gt; B[\"矢量模型\"]\n    A --&gt; C[\"栅格模型\"]\n    B --&gt; B1[\"点 Point&lt;br/&gt;城市、采样点\"]\n    B --&gt; B2[\"线 Line&lt;br/&gt;道路、河流\"]\n    B --&gt; B3[\"面 Polygon&lt;br/&gt;行政区、湖泊\"]\n    C --&gt; C1[\"规则网格&lt;br/&gt;每个像元存储一个值\"]\n    C --&gt; C2[\"应用: DEM、遥感影像&lt;br/&gt;土地利用分类\"]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>对比维度</th>\n<th>矢量模型</th>\n<th>栅格模型</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>数据结构</td>\n<td>坐标序列 + 拓扑关系</td>\n<td>行列像元矩阵</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>精度</td>\n<td>由采样精度决定</td>\n<td>由像元大小（分辨率）决定</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>存储效率</td>\n<td>边界复杂时高效</td>\n<td>大范围连续表面高效</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>拓扑关系</td>\n<td>明确支持</td>\n<td>隐式（需计算）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>典型应用</td>\n<td>行政边界、道路网、设施分布</td>\n<td>高程模型、遥感影像、降水分布</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>叠加分析</td>\n<td>需多边形裁切算法</td>\n<td>像元逐一运算，简单直接</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>矢量数据的常用格式包括 Shapefile（ESRI）、GeoJSON 和 GeoPackage；栅格数据常用 GeoTIFF 和 NetCDF。</p>\n<h3 id=\"二-坐标参考系统\">二、坐标参考系统</h3><p>地球是一个不规则的椭球体。将其三维表面映射到二维平面需要两步操作：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>大地基准面</strong>（datum）: 定义椭球体参数和原点（如 WGS84）</li>\n<li><strong>地图投影</strong>（projection）: 将椭球面展开到平面</li>\n</ol>\n<p>地理坐标系使用经纬度（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>λ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lambda</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>φ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\varphi</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span></span></span></span></span>）标识位置，单位为度：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>λ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>180</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><mo>−</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>φ</mi><mo>≤</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-180° \\leq \\lambda \\leq 180°, \\quad -90° \\leq \\varphi \\leq 90°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">180°</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">λ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">180°</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:1em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mord\">90°</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8304em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">φ</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90°</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>投影坐标系将经纬度转换为平面直角坐标（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">x</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">x</span></span></span></span></span>, <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>y</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">y</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">y</span></span></span></span></span>），单位通常为米。常用投影：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>投影</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>特点</th>\n<th>常用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>UTM</td>\n<td>横轴墨卡托</td>\n<td>分 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span></span></span></span></span> 个带，每带 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>6</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">6°</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">6°</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>大比例尺测绘</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Web Mercator</td>\n<td>正轴圆柱</td>\n<td>面积变形大，角度保持</td>\n<td>在线地图（Google Maps）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Albers 等积</td>\n<td>正轴圆锥</td>\n<td>面积准确</td>\n<td>统计制图</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Lambert 等角</td>\n<td>正轴圆锥</td>\n<td>角度准确</td>\n<td>航空导航</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>EPSG 代码是坐标系的唯一标识——WGS84 地理坐标为 EPSG:4326，Web Mercator 为 EPSG:3857，中国大地坐标系 CGCS2000 为 EPSG:4490。</p>\n<h3 id=\"三-属性数据与空间数据库\">三、属性数据与空间数据库</h3><p>GIS 中每个空间要素（feature）关联一条属性记录。属性表本质上是一张关系数据库表，每行对应一个空间实体，每列对应一个字段。</p>\n<p>空间查询的核心能力是结合<strong>属性条件</strong>和<strong>空间条件</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>SELECT</mtext><mo>∗</mo><mtext> FROM buildings WHERE floors</mtext><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext> AND ST_Within(geom, city_boundary)</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{SELECT} * \\text{ FROM } \\text{buildings WHERE } \\text{floors} &gt; 20 \\text{ AND } \\text{ST\\_Within(geom, city\\_boundary)}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">SELECT</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">∗</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> FROM </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">buildings WHERE </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">floors</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.06em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\"> AND </span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">ST_Within(geom, city_boundary)</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>PostGIS 是最流行的空间数据库扩展（基于 PostgreSQL），支持 OGC 标准的空间函数：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>功能</th>\n<th>示例</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>ST_Distance</td>\n<td>两个几何体之间的距离</td>\n<td>查找最近医院</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ST_Buffer</td>\n<td>创建缓冲区</td>\n<td>河流 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>500</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">500\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">500</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span> 保护带</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ST_Intersection</td>\n<td>计算交集</td>\n<td>森林与行政区重叠部分</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ST_Area</td>\n<td>计算面积</td>\n<td>统计各地块面积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ST_Contains</td>\n<td>判断包含关系</td>\n<td>点是否在某区域内</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"四-空间分析\">四、空间分析</h3><p>空间分析是 GIS 的核心能力，将地理数据转化为决策信息。</p>\n<p><strong>叠加分析</strong>（overlay）将两个或多个图层的空间关系和属性信息合并：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[&quot;图层A: 土地利用&quot;] --&gt; C[&quot;叠加运算&quot;]&#10;    B[&quot;图层B: 坡度分级&quot;] --&gt; C&#10;    C --&gt; D[&quot;结果: 各坡度带的&lt;br/&gt;土地利用类型分布&quot;]\">graph LR\n    A[\"图层A: 土地利用\"] --&gt; C[\"叠加运算\"]\n    B[\"图层B: 坡度分级\"] --&gt; C\n    C --&gt; D[\"结果: 各坡度带的&lt;br/&gt;土地利用类型分布\"]</pre><p>矢量叠加包括交集（intersect）、联合（union）和差集（erase）；栅格叠加是逐像元运算（map algebra）。</p>\n<p><strong>缓冲区分析</strong>（buffer）在要素周围创建指定距离的区域：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>g</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mi>p</mi><mo>∣</mo><mtext>dist</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>g</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B(g, d) = \\{p \\mid \\text{dist}(p, g) \\leq d\\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">∣</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">dist</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>g</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">g</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.625em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span> 为原始几何体，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>d</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">d</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">d</span></span></span></span></span> 为缓冲距离，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">B</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0502em;\">B</span></span></span></span></span> 为缓冲区。应用场景包括：学校周边 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>200</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">200\\,\\text{m}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">200</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">m</span></span></span></span></span></span> 禁售区、道路噪声影响带、水源保护区划定。</p>\n<p><strong>网络分析</strong>基于拓扑连通的线要素（如道路网）进行最短路径、服务区和旅行商问题求解。Dijkstra 算法是最短路径的经典解法，时间复杂度为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>V</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>E</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>V</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O((V + E) \\log V)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">((</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">E</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<h3 id=\"五-空间插值\">五、空间插值</h3><p>当采样点不连续时，需要通过插值估计未知位置的值。常用方法：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>方法</th>\n<th>原理</th>\n<th>优点</th>\n<th>局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>IDW（反距离加权）</td>\n<td>近邻点的加权平均，权重与距离成反比</td>\n<td>简单直观</td>\n<td>不能外推</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Kriging（克里金）</td>\n<td>基于半变异函数的最优无偏估计</td>\n<td>提供误差估计</td>\n<td>计算量大</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>样条插值</td>\n<td>通过已知点拟合光滑曲面</td>\n<td>表面光滑</td>\n<td>边缘可能振荡</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>自然邻域法</td>\n<td>基于 Voronoi 图的面积加权</td>\n<td>自动适应点密度</td>\n<td>凸包外无法估值</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>IDW 的数学表达为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mover accent=\"true\"><mi>Z</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mi>Z</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><mrow><munderover><mo>∑</mo><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mi>n</mi></munderover><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow></mfrac><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"1em\"/><msub><mi>w</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mi>d</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><msub><mi>s</mi><mi>i</mi></msub><msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mi>p</mi></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\hat{Z}(s_0) = \\frac{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i Z(s_i)}{\\sum_{i=1}^{n} w_i}, \\quad w_i = \\frac{1}{d(s_0, s_i)^p}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1968em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9468em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">Z</span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2523em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.1667em;\"><span class=\"mord\">^</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:2.488em;vertical-align:-0.994em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.494em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.3057em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop op-symbol small-op\" style=\"position:relative;top:0em;\">∑</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8043em;\"><span style=\"to